MSAA: depth EFB copies and depth peeks from a multisampled EFB (Seaborne patch 0023)

With AuroraConfig::msaa above 1 both were fatal ("not supported"). The multisampled depth is now resolved
(sample 0, a fragment shader writing frag_depth with an always-pass depth test) into a single-sample
depth texture of the EFB's size, kept while the size holds (tex_copy_conv::resolve_depth), and the depth
copy's conversion shaders and the depth peek's snapshot read that. The game's depth copies (depth of
field, the sun's visibility, bloom masks) and GXPeekZ then work with MSAA on.

